      <figcaption><strong>Plate XIV — The Decibel.</strong> A ratio scale, not a quantity — which is why the numbers mislead. Damage is a function of level <em>and</em> duration: eight hours at 85 dB and fifteen minutes at 100 dB do comparable harm.</figcaption>
